ok: bump executed against the pre-fork field
ok: field 1 reads 11 on the fork after the bump
ok: field 1 still reads 10 on the localnet
ok: add executed on the fork
ok: the new field reads 30 on the fork
ok: the registry's size is 3 on the fork
the localnet lists 2 fields, the fork lists 0
ok: the localnet still lists two fields
=== localnet: move on after the fork ===
ok: field 2 reads 21 on the localnet
ok: field 2 still reads 20 on the fork

